      "ml_enriched_product_description": "Discover Hass Avocado! Creamy, rich, and perfect for delicious salads, sandwiches, or guacamole. A versatile choice for any meal. Shop now at Woolworths.",
      "antiseptic": "False",
      "bpafree": "False",
      "vendorcostprice": null,
      "description": "<section>Hass Avocados offer a rich, creamy texture and flavour. These versatile fruits add a buttery touch to meals. Their pebbly skin darkens as they ripen.</section>\n\n<section><header>How to Pick:</header> Choose avocados that are firm but yield gently to pressure when ripe. Skin changes from green to dark purplish-black. Avoid soft spots.\n</section>\n\n<section><header>How to Store:</header> Ripen firm avocados at room temperature until soft. Once ripe, store in the refrigerator for up to five days.\n</section>\n\n<section><header>How to Prepare:</header> Cut avocado lengthwise around the central seed. Twist halves apart, tap seed with knife to remove. Scoop out creamy green flesh.\n</section>\n\n<section><header>Ways to Eat:</header> Enjoy Hass avocados mashed for guacamole, sliced in salads and sandwiches, or on toast. They add creamy richness to smoothies and tacos.\n</section>\n\n<section><header>Cooking Methods:</header> Grill, bake.</section>",
